  {
   "id": "b7",
   "function": "demonstration",
   "scene_type": "zlx_drive",
   "spoken": "So each valve opens only once in two revolutions. That is why the crankshaft drives the camshaft through a belt or chain, at half speed. And that is why the camshaft gear has twice as many teeth. The camshaft makes one turn while the crankshaft makes two.",
